+
+> Best AI tools for small businesses in 2026 should be affordable, auditable, and flexible enough to run on your own stack. This list focuses only on open source projects that exist as public GitHub repositories, so owners and operators can evaluate real code, self-host where needed, and avoid being locked into closed SaaS pricing.
