+#### [Flowise](https://github.com/FlowiseAI/Flowise)
+> **Description:** Flowise positions itself around building AI agents visually, and its README focuses on quick setup, Docker deployment, self-hosting, and modular node-based composition. That makes it attractive for lean teams that need to prototype knowledge bots, lead-routing flows, or AI automation without investing in a large engineering platform first. The project also exposes enough depth for developers who want to customize nodes, integrations, and runtime behavior later. For small-business operators, it sits in a good middle ground between toy builder and heavyweight enterprise stack.
+
