+> **Description:** Activepieces calls itself an open source replacement for Zapier and now leans heavily into AI agents, AI workflow automation, and MCP support. The README highlights an intuitive interface, open ecosystem, and a large piece catalog, which is useful for small businesses that need to automate busywork but still want code they can inspect. It is especially relevant for teams who want business automation first and AI augmentation second, rather than a chat-first product. The community edition is open source, while enterprise features are licensed separately, which is worth noting before adoption.
