+```
+
+## Contributing
+Contributions are welcome. Please keep the list focused on open source AI tools that are useful for small businesses and exist as public GitHub repositories.
+
+Submission rules:
+- The tool **must** have a public `github.com` repository URL.
+- No SaaS-only submissions.
+- Include the repo’s primary business use case.
+- Include GitHub stars, primary language, license, and recent activity if you can verify them.
+- If the license is custom, mixed, or non-standard, say so explicitly.
+
+See [CONTRIBUTING.md](./CONTRIBUTING.md) for the full process.
